"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"run.bat" execute the HunkIO application from the jar
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"HunkIO.class" HunkIO main Java program compiled byte code
"hunkio.manual.html" detailed HTML manual for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.jar" jarred class files: Library to read a file at once
"hunkio.look" uncommented jar manifest
"hunkio.jnlp" hunkio jnlp Java Web Start launch
"hunkio-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"hunkio.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"hunkio.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"hunkio.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"hunkio.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"hunkio.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"hunkio.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_hunkio.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_hunkio.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the HunkIO project files
"hunkio.use" precis(summary) Library to read a file at once Generated
"hunkio.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"hunkio.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"hunkio.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"hunkio.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.screenshot.png" screenshot for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.splash.gif" splash gif for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the HunkIO project
"hunkio.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the HunkIO project
"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for HunkIO, with one line descriptions.
"use.txt" key facts about the HunkIO project. Generates hunkio.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the HunkIO project. Generates hunkio.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the HunkIO project. Generates hunkio.use
"hunkio.txt" ASCII text manual for the HunkIO project.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for HunkIO
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for HunkIO
"forgather.xml" list of extra gather steps for ANT.
"forjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in hunkio.jar
"forjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in hunkio.jar
"forpost.xml" list of extra posting steps for ANT.
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in hunkio19.zip
"hunkio.xml" ASP PAD desc of the HunkIO project: Library to read a file at once
"hunkio19.zip" HunkIO 1.9 distribute zip: Library to read a file at once
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for hunkio19.zip
